#: templates/admin/elements/forms/group_journal_images.html:10
msgid ""
"Each image can be uploaded individually. Once an image is uploaded, options "
"to add alt text for accessibility will appear alongside the preview. For "
"details about where each image appears, see the <a "
"href=\"https://janeway.readthedocs.io/en/latest/manager/journal/index.html#images\">Journal"
" Images Settings</a> documentation."
